                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "On one hand, the characters are good, the action scenes are well written, and the setup is intriguing enough.\n\nOn the other hand, this is clearly the first episode of what never became a series. Though the main thread has enough closure, many other threads do not go anywhere, and because of that some characters which are presented as important end up being nearly irrelevant (and, as it is, a few scenes are so unconnected to the story, you have no clue why they are present).\n\nIt is actually a pity, because as a setup this game is very intriguing.... but if you decide to play it, know it is extremely incomplete. Score: 63/100.",
